        title: "What is your cancellation policy?",
        description: "We offer a full refund for cancellations made at least 24 hours before your rental period begins for single full day rentals. Cancellations made less than 24 hours before your rental period will be charged 50% of the rental fee. For multi-day rentals, cancellations made at least 48 hours before your rental period begins will receive a full refund. Cancellations made less than 48 hours before your rental period will be the first day of the rental period."
    },
    {
        title: "What are the requirements for towing a trailer?",
